\&\fBPROFILE\fR = ( \fIPROFILE HEAD\fR ) [ \fIATTACHMENT SPECIFICATION\fR ] [ \fIPROFILE FLAG CONDS\fR ] \*(Aq{\*(Aq ( \fIRULES\fR )* \*(Aq}\*(Aq
.Sp
