\&\fBUNIX RULE\fR = [ \fIQUALIFIERS\fR ] \*(Aqunix\*(Aq [ \fIUNIX ACCESS EXPR\fR ] [ \fIUNIX RULE CONDS\fR ] [ \fIUNIX LOCAL EXPR\fR ] [ \fIUNIX PEER EXPR\fR ]
